## Project Quick Facts

**Tech Stack:** Plain HTML/CSS/JS + modular ESM packages. No frameworks. Build: Parcel.

**Structure:**

- `packages/components/` — Individual accessible UI components
- `packages/css/` — Design tokens, grid, typography
- `packages/js/` — Utilities (`core`, `dom`)
- `scripts/` — Automation (scaffold, release)
- `src/` — Parcel entrypoint with component demos
- `docs/` — Documentation pages (component + foundations)

**Key Conventions:**

- Component name: `@wcag-ui/<kebab-name>` (tag: `wcag-<kebab-name>`)
- Docs folder: PascalCase (e.g., `docs/TreeView/TreeView.md`)
- Naming: Derive all variants (`camel`, `pascal`, `kebab`, `snake`, `UPPER_SNAKE`)
- CSS: Cascade Layers system (`wcag-ui.core`, `wcag-ui.foundations`, `wcag-ui.components`)
- ESM only — no CommonJS
- Linting: Biome (no alternate style tools)

**Deployment:**

- Scaffold: `pnpm component:add --component-name="Name" [options]`
- Release: `scripts/release.mjs` (detects bump, publishes, tags, updates changelog)
- Tests: `node --test ./__tests__/*.test.js`

---

## When Reviewing Code

1. **Always check:** `.ai/instructions/general.md` for naming, `.ai/styleguides/` (css.md, html.md, javascript.md) for style
2. **For a11y:** `.ai/context/accessibility.md` and `.ai/styleguides/accessibility.md` (WCAG 2.2)
3. **For testing:** `.ai/skills/custom-element-testing/` and `.ai/skills/accessibility-testing/`
4. **For new components:** Follow `.ai/context/component-anatomy.md` template

